## What changed

### 1. `design-rules/deterministic/generated/det-js-no-console-error.check.js`

Replaced the auto-generated stub with a real check that:

- Listens for **`console` type `error`** and **`pageerror`** (uncaught exceptions)
- Runs a bounded **golden-path smoke** (up to 5 clicks on safe controls: Bootstrap tabs/collapse, `<details>`, theme toggle, navbar toggler)
