```

After **`blend-rules`**, `design-rules/registry.generated.json` should show **`DET.JS.PROGRESSIVE`** with `"status": "implemented"` and `"implementationSource": "explicit-map"` (it is still `"stub"` until you run the blender).

### Design choices

- **Deterministic only** — word/H1 counts from DOM, no AI.
- **Dual navigation** — only when `page` is provided; precomputed `metrics.jsProgressiveReport` supported for tests or future crawl wiring.
- **Collection failures** — return no findings (avoids false positives on timeouts); crawl can pre-fill metrics later if needed.
