   - Moved `DET.LAYOUT.GRID_CONSISTENCY` from stub → implemented (partial update). **Re-run `npm run blend-rules`** to refresh the full registry fingerprint and any other mapping drift.

### Why these signals

They match the doc anchor without AI: measurable width/inset vs main and viewport, KS container patterns (`.doc-content`, Bootstrap containers), and gutter consistency within sections—same pattern as `det-chrome-boundary.check.js` (collect in browser → map to standard finding fields).

