The source rule says: *“Product/doc hubs include breadcrumb where registry marks chrome-region breadcrumb contract.”* That maps to measurable signals:

- **Hub detection** — layout hash slugs + doc-sidebar/showcase-header DOM (no AI)
- **Presence check** — Kbc root selector and standard breadcrumb landmarks
- **False-positive guard** — skip home and landing/marketing layouts

